OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's historic Pollok House
OL,4,Atransforms for art festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe stately Pollok House in Glasgow's
OL,7,Fsouthside has seen many visitors in its
OL,8,F274 years - but surely none quite like
OL,9,Fthis.
OL,11,FIn one room, glowing lightbulbs flash
OL,12,Fon and off while electronic music
OL,13,Fpulses alongside the lights. In another
OL,14,Froom, more than 150 bird sculptures are
OL,15,Fbeing moved into position, while opera
OL,16,Fmusic drifts along a corridor from
OL,17,Fupstairs.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
