OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow's historic Pollok House
OL,4,Atransforms for art festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Georgian building has been taken
OL,7,Fover as part of this year's Sonica
OL,8,Ffestival, an experimental audiovisual
OL,9,Fand art event that has been running for
OL,10,Fmore than a decade.
OL,12,FPollok House itself has been closed to
OL,13,Fthe public since 2023, when it shut for
OL,14,Fa renovation originally scheduled to
OL,15,Flast two years.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
